# Conditional Multiple Sections Example
# Parent concept defined in one section with conditional specs in a later section.
# From Story121/Story122: CPL Concepts Parser/Analyzer — Conditional

concepts
	Country=[Values[USA, Canada, Mexico]]

concepts
	# Conditional specs in a separate section
	Country[USA] => State=[Values[NY, CA, TX]]
	Country[Canada] => Province=[Values[Ontario, Quebec]]